<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble edged down to 15,500 in Minsk.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble edged down to 15,500 in Minsk.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged down to 15,500 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange from 15,050 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				     November 6	    November 5</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    15,500		  15,050</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $9.880 million	    $1.241 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
